  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4f10aa612ccd51d449f87e131a87002e, type: 3}
  portugueseText: "Adoro andar por S\xE3o Paulo, eu acho que n\xE3o existe no mundo
    um lugar t\xE3o \xFAnico, que mistura tantas culturas diferentes."
  englishText: "I love walking around S\xE3o Paulo. I don't think there's another
    place in the world so unique, that mixes so many cultures."
